# Alien Symbiosis: "You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other
# costs" (CR 113.6e-f, 601.3, 118.8), cast at the time an Aura may be (its ruling: "You must follow all normal timing
# rules"); "Enchanted creature gets +1/+1, has menace, and is a Symbiote in addition to its other types."
# Turn 1: Faithless Looting draws two Swamps and discards Alien Symbiosis and one Swamp. On Bot2's turn Bot1 holds
# priority in Bot2's main phase with Mox Jet and Mox Pearl untapped, and the Aura is not offered: it is no instant. On
# turn 3 Mox Jet is tapped in the upkeep, and with Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl untapped the Aura is not offered: the
# permission lets no mana of any type pay (CR 609.4b), so {B} needs black mana. A Swamp is played, it and Mox Pearl pay
# {1}{B} exactly and Lightning Bolt is discarded for the additional cost. Ornithopter (0/2 Thopter, flying) becomes a
# 1/3 Symbiote Thopter with flying and menace; Bolt is in the graveyard and the one card left in hand is a Swamp.

